# Line endings are LF in the repository AND in the working copy, on every machine.
#
# This is not a preference. Without `eol=lf`, git on Windows checks these files out as CRLF, and a
# comparison against anything that is LF -- the old BergAndSorensen2026_circular repository, a zip
# downloaded from Overleaf, a co-author's clone on a Mac -- shows every line of every file as changed.
# That happened once already: two copies of the paper looked hundreds of lines apart and were 29.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.eps   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.jld2  binary
